# Blocker / review / failure

Never represent unfinished or failed work as success.

## REVIEW_REQUIRED

Stop before the protected action. Document the exact human action. Do not continue until confirmed.

## BLOCKED

Scoped diagnostics only. Record the failed command, evidence, and last successful step. Wait for guidance.

## FAILED

Stop further changes. Preserve evidence. Do not commit or deploy failed work unless explicitly directed.

Never include secrets or full sensitive logs.
